      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포핀의 재료. 푹신푹신한 땅에 심으면 라즈가 자란다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作寶芬的材料。 埋進鬆軟的泥土裡， 長成後會結出蔓莓。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient entrant dans la confection de Poffins. Plantez cette Baie dans un sol meuble et fertile pour faire pousser un arbre à Baies Framby.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Knursp-Zutat. Pflanze sie in weichen Lehmboden ein, damit neue Himmihbeeren wachsen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ingrediente para pokochos. Si se planta en tierra suelta, saldrá una planta de Frambu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si usa per fare i poffin. Seminala nella terra soffice per far crescere una pianta di Baccalampon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient. Bury it in soft soil to grow a Razz Berry plant.",
